      "position": 1,
      "nearest_heading": "Exponential Function",
      "prompt_text": "Identifying Exponential Functions Which of the following equations are not exponential functions? $f (x) = 4^{3 (x - 2)}$ $g (x) = x^{3}$ $h (x) = \\left(\\right. \\frac{1}{3} \\left.\\right)^{x}$ $j (x) = (- 2)^{x}$",
